  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag1.111" class="h1">Thag 1:111  Jenta</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Going forth is hard;</p>
              <p class="v2">houses are hard places to live;</p>
              <p>the Dhamma is deep;</p>
              <p class="v2">wealth, hard to obtain;</p>
              <p>it’s hard to keep going</p>
              <p>with whatever we get:</p>
              <p class="v2">So it’s right that we ponder</p>
              <p class="v2">continually</p>
              <p class="v2">continual</p>
              <p class="v2">inconstancy.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../Dhp/Ch21.html#dhp302">Dhp 302</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
